 "titulo": "Something crawls under the cemetery lawn ⚰️ Part 2 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "NEVER STEP ON IT",
 "descripcion": "Eli broke rule three by accident. He stepped on fresh dirt after midnight. And the ground under the lawn started following him.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you run or stay still?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Part two. Eli jumps back from the grave, and his boot lands on *fresh dirt*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Rule three. Never step on fresh dirt after midnight.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The ground sinks under his foot, soft, warm, like a chest breathing.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the digging stops.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "For a second, the whole cemetery is silent.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli walks away slowly, flashlight down, counting his steps.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind him, the grass *bulges* and flattens. Bulges and flattens.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Something is crawling under the lawn, following him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because Eli found the only place it couldn't reach.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He runs to the old *mausoleum* and climbs onto the stone roof.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The line under the grass circles the mausoleum. Once. Twice.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His radio crackles. Static. Then a voice he doesn't know.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "New guy, stay up there. It doesn't like stone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 3:40 AM, the circling stops right below him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli shines the light down at the dirt.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A hand made of soil pushes out of the ground.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It *waves at him*, slowly, like it's saying hello.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then it points at his house. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
